==Trivia==
*As of [[Version 12.0 Update|version 12.0]], waiting on the Main Menu for long enough will lead to a [https://youtube.com/shorts/4IkdXY_07S0 brief animation] in which the [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|True Superfeline]] on the logo blinks and wags its tail for a few seconds before the tail disappears again.
*Most of the [[Enemy Bases|enemy bases]] in the Main Menu's default background are from the [[Empire of Cats Levels (JP)|Japanese version]] of [[Empire of Cats]].
*Ironically, none of the bases from [[Into the Future]] are present in its menu background.

